   "url": "https://home.treasury.gov/news/press-releases/sb0251",
   "text": "When, for example, a financial institution invests the time and money to experiment with AI and successfully drops its false positive ratio and escalates vital information to law enforcement more rapidly, their team should be celebrated, not written up.",
